  "ruleText": "Csp 304.04 Reports to Commission. The trustee shall make quarterly reports regarding the status of the trust to the commission.\n\nSource. #7083, eff 8-26-99, EXPIRED: 8-26-07\n\nNew. #9585, eff 11-2-09; ss by #11097, eff 5-17-16; ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
